# The action's image is built from the repository root, because it bundles several services.
# Without this file the build context carries every node_modules tree and the whole git history,
# which is hundreds of megabytes the image never uses.
#
# The per-service Dockerfiles build from their own directories and are unaffected by this file.

.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
frontend
benchmarks
infrastructure
docs
scripts
proto
.firebase
*.md
!action/README.md
docker-compose.yml
firebase.json
